================================================================================================
  t0 < pi/(6L) = 0.523599 must give t0 sum_m L_ker(m t0) f(m t0) = int L_ker f dt.
  A grid that is too COARSE must break it - otherwise the agreement below
  the threshold is not evidence the band limit is being respected.

      t0        t0/(pi/6L)     discrete sum       exact         abs err   verdict
  ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
